Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
We hope that you are enjoying your first semester with ASU Online! We are happy you took the opportunity to enroll in additional coursework for Session B. Adding courses may impact your charges and financial aid awards. We are here to help you understand this adjustment should you need support. Please feel free to give us a call back at 855-278-5080 or reply to this email.
Sincerely, {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
Financial Aid and Scholarship Services Arizona State University PO Box 870412 Tempe, AZ 85287-0412 Phone: 1-844-278-6693
If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.
